	<logo>https://static.globalissues.org/i/globalissues/logo-feed.jpg</logo><entry><id>https://www.globalissues.org/news/2026/08/28/43913</id><title>Will the Future of the UN be Dictated by a Hostile US?</title><updated>2026-08-28T05:46:42-07:00</updated><link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://www.globalissues.org/news/2026/08/28/43913" /><link rel="enclosure" type="image/jpeg" href="https://static.globalissues.org/ips/2026/08/Future-of-the-UN_.jpg" /><media:content url="https://static.globalissues.org/ips/2026/08/Future-of-the-UN_.jpg" type="image/jpeg" medium="image" /><media:thumbnail url="https://static.globalissues.org/ips/2026/08/Future-of-the-UN_-100x100.jpg" width="100" height="100" /><summary type="html">&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://static.globalissues.org/ips/2026/08/Future-of-the-UN_.jpg&quot; width=&quot;640&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;
UNITED NATIONS, August 28 (IPS)  - As the UN commemorates its 81st anniversary, one lingering question remains: what is  the future of the world body.?Will a hostile US downsize its operations at the United Nations, cut down its funding, continue defaulting in its payments — and perhaps eventually, withdraw from the world body?
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.globalissues.org/news/2026/08/28/43913&quot;&gt;Read the full story, “Will the Future of the UN be Dictated by a Hostile US?”, on globalissues.org&lt;/a&gt; →&lt;/p&gt;</summary></entry><entry><id>https://www.globalissues.org/news/2026/08/27/43910</id><title>U.S. Midwest Flooding Is a Growing Threat to Agriculture</title><updated>2026-08-27T13:36:46-07:00</updated><link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://www.globalissues.org/news/2026/08/27/43910" /><link rel="enclosure" type="image/jpeg" href="https://static.globalissues.org/ips/2026/08/usmidwestflooding.jpg" /><media:content url="https://static.globalissues.org/ips/2026/08/usmidwestflooding.jpg" type="image/jpeg" medium="image" /><media:thumbnail url="https://static.globalissues.org/ips/2026/08/usmidwestflooding-100x100.jpg" width="100" height="100" /><summary type="html">&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://static.globalissues.org/ips/2026/08/usmidwestflooding.jpg&quot; width=&quot;640&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;
